                        "glosses": [
                            "A kind of gate or portcullis, having iron bars, like a harrow, studded with iron spikes, hung above gateways so that it may be quickly lowered to impede the advance of an enemy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
