                                "sense_id": "74366675-44a5-3135-8b7b-ab7204a21aa7",
                                "text": "In the south aisle, on a slab raised on four low shafts and covered by an iron herse, is a fine coloured recumbent effigy of a bishop"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
